{"name": "Realm of Advent", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you love building unique decks, triggering insane combos with simple controls, and watching numbers skyrocket out of control\u2014 </strong><br/><strong>then you'll love Realm of Advent.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In a desperate world after the arrival of Apostles, craft your build from over 300 cards and relics to ignite addictively satisfying combos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Domino-Style Chain Reactions + Balatro-Level Number Explosions!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine cards and relics to forge diverse strategic synergies. Unleash infinite possibilities and vanquish formidable Apostles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"654\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060830/extras/ba0297b5000b21fe1a4788c0f8e604df.poster.avif?t=1790186131\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060830/extras/ba0297b5000b21fe1a4788c0f8e604df.webm?t=1790186131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060830/extras/ba0297b5000b21fe1a4788c0f8e604df.mp4?t=1790186131\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Monster Train-Style Deep Card Crafting!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Initiate Rituals: Transform, Destroy, Socket Gems, Infuse Brands, and shape your destiny through impactful world events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"654\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060830/extras/ceb3840885a227e7be3ec03d6c9c0786.poster.avif?t=1790186131\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060830/extras/ceb3840885a227e7be3ec03d6c9c0786.webm?t=1790186131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060830/extras/ceb3840885a227e7be3ec03d6c9c0786.mp4?t=1790186131\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vibrant Animations &amp; Dynamic Visuals!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique dynamic character art paired with silky-smooth card movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060830/extras/51b8fa233bb724d0242e5439b0f63a2d.poster.avif?t=1790186131\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060830/extras/51b8fa233bb724d0242e5439b0f63a2d.webm?t=1790186131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060830/extras/51b8fa233bb724d0242e5439b0f63a2d.mp4?t=1790186131\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple Controls, Deep Strategy!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No complex micro-management\u2014simply move, swap, and position your battle queue to experience thrilling and exhilarating combat loops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060830/extras/c2a32ac8382286a779de09cb54ab9a5a.poster.avif?t=1790186131\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060830/extras/c2a32ac8382286a779de09cb54ab9a5a.webm?t=1790186131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060830/extras/c2a32ac8382286a779de09cb54ab9a5a.mp4?t=1790186131\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><u>They bring light, and that light is the only color.</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><u>They bring song, and that song is the only melody.</u></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">155+ Relics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">45+ Candles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">235+ Cards</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">45+ Bosses</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">13 Ascension Difficulties</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you enjoy Deck-Building games (DBG), Roguelikes, Auto-Battlers, or love any of the following titles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slay the Spire | Monster Train | Hearthstone Battlegrounds | The Bazaar | Balatro,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you will definitely fall in love with Realm of Advent. Step into a post-apocalyptic world, combine over 300 cards and relics, and detonate truly addictive chain reactions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "If you love building unique decks, triggering insane combos with simple controls, and watching numbers skyrocket\u2014you'll love Realm of Advent. In a world ruled by Apostles, craft your build from 300+ cards and relics to ignite addictively wild chain reactions.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060830/cb805c1914d052453d5e79ff86eeb9691307cc03/header.jpg?t=1790186131", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Auto 